  "Choose two vectors and let them melt into one architecture — the Nexus then routes through both territories at once.": "Elige dos vectores y deja que se fundan en una sola arquitectura — el Nexus entonces dirige a través de ambos territorios a la vez.",
  "Evolve Med": "Evolve Med",
