  "Where the world's instruments measure, ParticleX articulates. The articulation is its own — and it is offered to the curious, not to the convinced.": "Donde los instrumentos del mundo miden, ParticleX articula. La articulación es suya — y se ofrece a los curiosos, no a los convencidos.",
